<h3>Indent <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">text-mode</code> region</h3>

<div class="language-elisp highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">defun</span> <span class="nv">prot-text-insert-prefix</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="nv">prefix</span> <span class="nb">string</span><span class="p">)</span>
